## This tool bank's own CAD layer key (unchanged, do not fork per typology)

This bank draws everything on its existing AIA-style key (`A-WALL`, `A-ROOM-BNDY`, `A-DOOR`,
...) regardless of typology — dozens of validator rules assume it, and forking it per typology
would be a breaking change (rule 02). Typology-specific layers (if any) extend the existing key
with a typology prefix, e.g. `hospital.walls.lead-shield-on-layer` scoping to `A-WALL-LEAD`, not
a wholesale replacement.

